00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:55.360
The options play IV color coding tool, color codes implied volatility levels on earnings names.

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:59.840
Red signals expensive premium, yellow indicates relatively cheap.

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:02.540
Green marks extremely depressed IV.

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:08.580
This gives retail traders the same quick visual filter professionals use when deciding between

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:12.020
long premium and credit spreads ahead of binary events.

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:18.760
Canadian investors can access the same logic inside any options chain that displays IV rank.

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:24.140
No paid subscription is required if your broker already surfaces the percentile rank.

